            <p>He stares at it. This wasn't here before. He hesitates. Then taps.</p>

            <p>The screen shifts. A <span style="color: #00d4ff; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">Life Book</span> opens. Data lines run alongside her image. Indexed. Weighed. Assigned. His eyes widen. He reads the feed, lips shaping the words.</p>

            <p>Then her name: <span style="color: #ffaa00;">ella.</span></p>

            <p>The system has cataloged her moments, each rendered in code.</p>

