            <p>He rereads the warning. It was not created by this system. It surfaced through an unintended pathway; a breach. A forbidden function spoken of only in rumor, never meant to touch mortal code. Yet it sits there now. Embedded. Real.</p>

            <p><span style="color: #00ff41; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">ApostasiaVitae()</span>. A suicide. Scheduled. Final. Assigned to <span style="color: #ffaa00;">ella</span>.</p>

            <p>He sets down the memo. The words linger.</p>

